{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_title", "source_sha256": "d52431c60f40b395119df68073967a2d441d8ec18f13f4eb36ec0eda951e424f", "ja": "ミリシタ感謝祭　前説", "zh": "MLTD感谢祭 开场致辞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "deabd99045146a76570dcb3ae6851a45ea5e2aa32fe4fad13a02af605ce0b9cd", "ja": "ミリシタ感謝祭の開催に際しての\n社長からの挨拶と、事務員からの前説です。", "zh": "这是百万现场感谢祭举办之际，社长的致辞和事务员的开场说明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1000_president", "source_sha256": "672780f6ff52cd08821081c1c5a180d2daf450376eb8881a2b0ce1faf372f5de", "ja": "うおっほん！　『ミリシタ感謝祭』会場にお集まりの\nプロデューサー諸君！", "zh": "咳咳！　聚集在“百万现场感谢祭”会场的\n各位制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1001_president", "source_sha256": "cc71f3135198fe13fc713d13914865107842b48ad3368dac387389d8956996af", "ja": "並びに、配信で本公演を視聴してくれている\nプロデューサー諸君！", "zh": "以及正在通过直播观看本场公演的各位制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1002_president", "source_sha256": "30da34cc82c6a0ba172b952e8604108cdc821fc2c584406fb5be06b3251c1c3b", "ja": "元気にしているかねーっ！", "zh": "还精神吗——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1003_president", "source_sha256": "4bf9ff204a46d3a930cc36082f9c1c626e84376c8b244124f240f4b3bc5aa70d", "ja": "うんうん、いい返事だ！\n元気こそがプロデュースの源、実に頼もしい！", "zh": "嗯嗯，回答得好！\n活力正是制作的源泉，实在令人欣慰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1004_president", "source_sha256": "157866e0594eb11b65ad222376429ff8087583b0caf60e9d6bcf6f57d041bf8f", "ja": "私は高木順二朗、\n765プロダクションの社長をしている男だ。", "zh": "我是高木顺二朗，\n是765事务所的社长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1005_president", "source_sha256": "99a50981c68c490ad4890ab2c3b7c33ea2a0899b7b2748472dfbb302fe02df34", "ja": "我が765プロライブ劇場は、開幕してからこれまで、\n順調に公演を重ね、常に好評を博し続けてきた。", "zh": "我们的第765专业现场演出剧场自开幕以来，一直顺利地举办一场又一场公演，始终广受好评。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1006_president", "source_sha256": "761431fba2004b88b310128ca6b06d7b70544644b60c8b9824f2a128c95fc275", "ja": "これもひとえに、社長である私の先見の明と、\n経営手腕のなせるわざ……と言いたいところだが、", "zh": "这也全都归功于身为社长的我的远见卓识和经营手腕……本来想这么说来着，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1007_president", "source_sha256": "94936fa7e09461bb29349dd859e1ca76998e99be1e1780f8afa2d2ab90a9d495", "ja": "実際はまぎれもなく、アイドル達の成長を陰に日なた\nにと支え、プロデュースしてきてくれた諸君のお陰だ！", "zh": "这实际上毫无疑问是多亏了各位在台前幕后\n支持着偶像们的成长，一直悉心制作的功劳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1008_president", "source_sha256": "69664a8360d7497d53cd76759d9e8997b5b936891df3d98436a284a6564b3e43", "ja": "まずは、改めて礼を言わせてもらおう。\n本当に、ありがとうー！", "zh": "首先，请让我再次向你道谢。  \n真的，谢谢你——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1009_president", "source_sha256": "04c5feea56faf643175a6371498efa820f776acbafc42675bb31237c80b49cc0", "ja": "今日はそんな諸君を始め、劇場を支えてくれている\nすべての人々に、感謝の気持ちを伝えたい！", "zh": "今天，我想向包括这样的各位在内、一直支持着剧场的所有人，表达感谢之情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1010_president", "source_sha256": "76d6abb6b38a91c19a28a99df75f06f1edb27d4609df9f40c1b9d9e1ad4009ce", "ja": "そう考えて、この特別な公演を開催させてもらった。", "zh": "正是这样想的，所以才得以举办这场特别的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1011_president", "source_sha256": "e68f956953a72ae68cb29e807345414373a1a08fbbebb73b12c9e1af053d3ac5", "ja": "アイドル達のステージはもちろん、趣向を凝らした演出\nも用意しているから、存分に楽しんでくれたまえ！", "zh": "除了偶像们的舞台表演，我们还准备了精心设计的演出，请尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1012_president", "source_sha256": "536e20f7a9d6e9120a3329dd3a44b7080fefb8b3a7c64d58083c8d7233e90db2", "ja": "そうそう、趣向を凝らすと言えば、今日は手品ではなく\n趣向を凝らした影絵を披露しようかと……！", "zh": "对了，说到别出心裁，今天不变魔术，而是想表演一场别出心裁的皮影戏……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1013_president", "source_sha256": "8818f2d7403b5f298f128d7e7fe1c69f7d2abf86cd11fd8c9b67380d84d47893", "ja": "思ったのだが、どうやら私の持ち時間はこれまでの\nようだ。影絵はまた後日、披露するとしよう。", "zh": "想来，我的时间似乎就到此为止了。\n手影戏就改日再为大家表演吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1014_president", "source_sha256": "5f4b22567dd8e83b078586eb42f4c03458e0d4649518a46186ac00ec3f55bba7", "ja": "それでは後のことは……。\n青羽君！　よろしく頼んだよ！", "zh": "那么接下来的事就……  \n青羽！拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "21a8102e156403f0b484cb082f6ce553c4c809adac79c389822bc9d5648e187a", "ja": "はいっ、社長さん！\nよ～しっ、しっかり前説しなきゃ！", "zh": "好的，社长先生！\n好～！得好好做开场介绍才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "6ac5827b93733591bd889957893a95bc0a4678d2b63bfb0bec184aae0ca5c2a2", "ja": "それにしても……ここの会場って、\n上の階の席も、すごく近くに感じるなぁ～。", "zh": "不过话说回来……这里的会场，\n连楼上的座位都感觉离得特别近呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "790de3606476b7c9ace6ed980c69cb8de46c63499233b107f3bfd891821cfad0", "ja": "ステージを客席が、ぐるーって取り囲んでいて……\nまるで、みんなに見守ってもらえているみたい……。", "zh": "观众席把舞台团团围住……  \n感觉就像一直被大家守望着一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1018_102mis", "source_sha256": "53b5c1b40664aeb264f7fa6acf78dffd5d169ef89157dd2bde1970977ae51f3a", "ja": "えへへっ！　プロデューサーさんたちのお顔が、\nみ～んな、よーく見えますよ～～～！", "zh": "嘿嘿！制作人先生们的脸，\n全都看得清清楚楚哦～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1019_102mis", "source_sha256": "6f93543c68b3567a90627f4005423c541ebd4bbf71d70c9bf93660e8c47b0936", "ja": "って、ああーっ！　私ったら、挨拶がまだでした！\nえ、えーと、それじゃあ改めまして……。おほん！", "zh": "啊——！我真是的，还没打招呼呢！\n呃、呃——那么重新来一次……。咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1020_102mis", "source_sha256": "e6f4cb160cee5216735bdf0d6b5362a6c3191e467dcdb9720eeeb2b16dbfc59c", "ja": "プロデューサーさんの皆さ～ん！　お疲れ様で～す！", "zh": "制作人先生，大家辛苦啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1021_102mis", "source_sha256": "ad301b43854c36cba5f883a4861c3c7fd700ffb2e48e6f08c2b7db932766d6a1", "ja": "私は、765プロライブ劇場の劇場事務員、\n青羽美咲と申します！　よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "我是765专业现场剧场的剧场事务员，青羽美咲！请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1022_102mis", "source_sha256": "f800f211bd766dc49332088bc8a0be59f9e038a02ca88c67a2f3abfc02fc6f91", "ja": "本日は、たくさんお集まりいただき、ありがとう\nございます！　みなさん、盛り上がってますか～？", "zh": "感谢大家今天前来！各位，气氛热烈吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1023_102mis", "source_sha256": "3fdd2c5e08b10e947d31842f9097d612b7a9a7c6f3e59b5d784ae5d6ff4add94", "ja": "わあっ、みなさん、すごい熱気ですね！\n私も、頑張って準備してきたかいがあります♪", "zh": "哇，大家的热情真是高涨呢！\n我也觉得努力准备都值了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1024_102mis", "source_sha256": "b57e8c3b46dcb6de2970b382e750b093beac3ca2c662b6859d2a0922fde43f8b", "ja": "今日は、いつもとちょっと違った演出も\n取り入れているので、期待してくださいねー！", "zh": "今天也加入了一些与平时稍有不同的演出，请大家期待哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1025_102mis", "source_sha256": "9bdcd7608c6bb6d75c7eee4b5be0e87b9574fcd8d2bffd72af33ea56cd668565", "ja": "それと、アプリから視聴していただいているみなさんは\nコメントやスタンプを送ったり……、", "zh": "另外，通过应用观看的各位也可以发送评论和贴纸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1026_102mis", "source_sha256": "d4165c42d9831f5bd8ce032747bfe7b88582015e824965ecbb010e64ffde558c", "ja": "コンサートライトを振ることが出来ますので、\nそちらも楽しんで、ライブに参加してくださいね～！", "zh": "大家还可以挥动演唱会荧光棒，也请享受这个环节，参与现场演出吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1027_102mis", "source_sha256": "ee937b260c0ccfccd1a494afcf7c49564e8b3c33b2c3532b8076ffbeb46207ae", "ja": "それでは、これから公演に先駆けまして、\n注意事項をお伝えいたします！", "zh": "那么接下来，在演出开始前，先向大家说明注意事项！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1028_102mis", "source_sha256": "1a55f925de887b57449a0721d8aa83d41471cc18cd8b88fa46c549cb66edd72f", "ja": "まずはじめに、公演中はカメラによる撮影や、\nレコーダーによる音声の録音も禁止といたします。", "zh": "首先，演出期间禁止使用相机拍摄，也禁止使用录音设备录音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1029_102mis", "source_sha256": "1eb839218962c7ebe555f34a584eb4712e89538ff2b13bcbbeb6806500cfb065", "ja": "また、会場にお越しのみなさんは、本業に専念して\nいただくため、携帯電話の電源はお切りください。", "zh": "另外，为了让来到会场的各位专心欣赏演出，请关闭手机电源。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1030_102mis", "source_sha256": "d67f6d33c5f8ded444f8997d3ff85bc2cb682ad72bdd7f970c99521c3613a5ac", "ja": "あっ、でも携帯電話でご覧のプロデューサーさんは、\n電源を切らないでくださいねっ！", "zh": "啊，不过用手机观看的制作人，请不要关机哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1031_102mis", "source_sha256": "be41d6ae0dabe214bf2ca459be3c4b9c91049c5e13d2ea1d1fc860ad48cb137c", "ja": "画面を通して、ステージで輝くアイドルのみんなを、\nしっかり見守ってあげてください♪", "zh": "请透过屏幕，好好守望在舞台上闪耀的偶像们吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_007_fkn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkn_01_1032_102mis", "source_sha256": "8c0e19024800e2560cf123b9eab58fe87d51e463bf36810b70b038526b151ada", "ja": "次に、応援の際は、周りの人に\n迷惑がかからないよう、ご注意ください。", "zh": "接下来，加油时请注意不要给周围的人添麻烦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
